### Atome Connector API (PyCharm HTTP Client)
### Pick the "local" environment. {{host}} and {{db}} come from http-client.env.json,
### {{apiKey}} from http-client.private.env.json (copy the .example file; it is git-ignored).

### 1. Health (no API key needed)
GET {{host}}/atome/api/v1/health
X-Odoo-Database: {{db}}

### 2. Missing key -> 401 UNAUTHENTICATED
GET {{host}}/atome/api/v1/products
X-Odoo-Database: {{db}}

### 3. Products, optionally filtered: ?category=FIRE_RATED&q=door
GET {{host}}/atome/api/v1/products?category=FIRE_RATED
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Odoo-Database: {{db}}

### 4. Create a draft quotation -> 201 QUOTATION_CREATED
###    Run it twice: the second call returns 200 QUOTATION_ALREADY_EXISTS (no duplicate).
POST {{host}}/atome/api/v1/quotations
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Odoo-Database: {{db}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "atome_reference": "ATM-1001",
  "customer": { "name": "Harbourline Construction Ltd" },
  "create_customer_if_missing": true,
  "lines": [
    { "door_category": "FIRE_RATED", "description": "D-101 - Fire-rated door, 2100 x 900 mm", "qty": 4, "unit_price": "1250.00" },
    { "door_category": "STANDARD", "qty": 6, "unit_price": 410.5 }
  ]
}

### 5. Validation errors -> 422 VALIDATION_FAILED with data.fields
POST {{host}}/atome/api/v1/quotations
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Odoo-Database: {{db}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "atome_reference": "x",
  "customer": {},
  "lines": [
    { "door_category": "WOODEN", "qty": 0, "unit_price": "abc" },
    { "qty": 2, "unit_price": "1.234" }
  ]
}

### 6. Invalid JSON -> 400 INVALID_JSON
POST {{host}}/atome/api/v1/quotations
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Odoo-Database: {{db}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ not json

### 7. One quotation by Atome reference (404 QUOTATION_NOT_FOUND if unknown)
GET {{host}}/atome/api/v1/quotations/ATM-1001
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Odoo-Database: {{db}}

### 8. List, newest first, cursor pagination: use pagination.nextCursor as ?cursor=
GET {{host}}/atome/api/v1/quotations?limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Odoo-Database: {{db}}

### 9. Wrong method -> 405 METHOD_NOT_ALLOWED
DELETE {{host}}/atome/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
X-Odoo-Database: {{db}}
